{"1-4":{"people":[{"id":"moses-h4872","name":"Moses","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Amram","count":3,"firstVerse":1},{"id":"eleazar-h0499g","name":"Eleazar","kind":"person","brief":"A High Priest","count":2,"firstVerse":1},{"id":"aaron-h0175","name":"Aaron","kind":"person","brief":"High Priest","count":1,"firstVerse":1},{"id":"israel-h3478","name":"Israel","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Isaac","count":2,"firstVerse":2}],"places":[{"id":"jericho-h3405g","name":"Jericho","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":3},{"id":"jordan-h3383","name":"Jordan","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":3},{"id":"moab-plains-h4124i","name":"Moab Plains","kind":"place","brief":"In Moab","count":1,"firstVerse":3},{"id":"egypt-h4714g","name":"Egypt","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":4}],"words":[{"base":"H0499","lemma":"אֶלְעָזָר","tr":"el·a·zar","gloss":"Eleazar","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":72},{"base":"H4872","lemma":"מֹשֶׁה","tr":"mo·sheh","gloss":"Moses","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":766},{"base":"H4605","lemma":"מַ֫עַל","tr":"ma·al","gloss":"above","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":140},{"base":"H6242","lemma":"עֶשְׂרִים","tr":"es·rim","gloss":"twenty","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":315},{"base":"H3548","lemma":"כֹּהֵן","tr":"ko·hen","gloss":"priest","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":750},{"base":"H8141","lemma":"שָׁנָה","tr":"sha·neh","gloss":"year","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":877},{"base":"H3318","lemma":"יָצָא","tr":"ya·tsa","gloss":"to come out: come","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":1067},{"base":"H4046","lemma":"מַגֵּפָה","tr":"mag·ge·phah","gloss":"plague","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":26},{"base":"H3405","lemma":"יְרִיחוֹ","tr":"ye·ri·cho","gloss":"Jericho","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":57},{"base":"H6160","lemma":"עֲרָבָה","tr":"a·ra·vah","gloss":"Arabah","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":61}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"EXO","chapter":38,"verse":25,"verseEnd":25,"votes":5,"source":"openbible","text":"The silver from those numbered among the congregation totaled 100 talents and 1,775 shekels, according to the sanctuary shekel—","from":2},{"book":"EXO","chapter":38,"verse":26,"verseEnd":26,"votes":5,"source":"openbible","text":"a beka per person, that is, half a shekel, according to the sanctuary shekel, from everyone twenty years of age or older who had crossed over to be numbered, a total of 603,550 men.","from":2},{"book":"NUM","chapter":22,"verse":1,"verseEnd":1,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"Then the Israelites traveled on and camped in the plains of Moab near the Jordan, across from Jericho.","from":3},{"book":"NUM","chapter":25,"verse":9,"verseEnd":9,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"but those who died in the plague numbered 24,000.","from":1},{"book":"EXO","chapter":30,"verse":12,"verseEnd":12,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"“When you take a census of the Israelites to number them, each man must pay the LORD a ransom for his life when he is counted. Then no plague will come upon them when they are numbered.","from":2},{"book":"EXO","chapter":38,"verse":25,"verseEnd":26,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"The silver from those numbered among the congregation totaled 100 talents and 1,775 shekels, according to the sanctuary shekel— a beka per person, that is, half a shekel, according to the sanctuary shekel, from everyone twenty years of age or older who had crossed over to be numbered, a total of 603,550 men.","from":2},{"book":"NUM","chapter":1,"verse":1,"verseEnd":1,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"On the first day of the second month of the second year after the Israelites had come out of the land of Egypt, the LORD spoke to Moses in the Tent of Meeting in the Wilderness of Sinai. He said:","from":4},{"book":"NUM","chapter":1,"verse":2,"verseEnd":3,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"“Take a census of the whole congregation of Israel by their clans and families, listing every man by name, one by one. You and Aaron are to number those who are twenty years of age or older by their divisions—everyone who can serve in Israelʼs army.","from":2}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"exodus-family","title":"Moses and his circle","people":3}]},"5-11":{"people":[{"id":"pallu-h6396","name":"Pallu","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Reuben","count":2,"firstVerse":5},{"id":"reuben-h7205","name":"Reuben","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":2,"firstVerse":5},{"id":"hanoch-h2585j","name":"Hanoch","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Reuben","count":1,"firstVerse":5},{"id":"israel-h3478","name":"Israel","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Isaac","count":1,"firstVerse":5},{"id":"carmi-h3756g","name":"Carmi","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Reuben","count":1,"firstVerse":6},{"id":"hezron-h2696g","name":"Hezron","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Reuben","count":1,"firstVerse":6},{"id":"hezron-h2696h","name":"Hezron","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Perez","count":1,"firstVerse":6},{"id":"eliab-h0446h","name":"Eliab","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Pallu","count":2,"firstVerse":8},{"id":"korah-h7141i","name":"Korah","kind":"person","brief":"Aaron's adversary","count":3,"firstVerse":9},{"id":"aaron-h0175","name":"Aaron","kind":"person","brief":"High Priest","count":1,"firstVerse":9},{"id":"abiram-h0048g","name":"Abiram","kind":"person","brief":"Aaron's adversary","count":1,"firstVerse":9},{"id":"dathan-h1885","name":"Dathan","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Eliab","count":1,"firstVerse":9},{"id":"moses-h4872","name":"Moses","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Amram","count":1,"firstVerse":9},{"id":"nemuel-h5241g","name":"Nemuel","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Eliab","count":1,"firstVerse":9}],"places":[],"words":[{"base":"H4940","lemma":"מִשְׁפָּחָה","tr":"mish·pa·chah","gloss":"family","lang":"h","inPassage":5,"uses":303},{"base":"H7141","lemma":"קֹ֫רַח","tr":"qo·rach","gloss":"Korah","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":37},{"base":"H6396","lemma":"פַּלּוּא","tr":"pal·lu","gloss":"Pallu","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":5},{"base":"H5712","lemma":"עֵדָה","tr":"e·dah","gloss":"congregation","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":149},{"base":"H1885","lemma":"דָּתָן","tr":"da·tan","gloss":"Dathan","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":10},{"base":"H0048","lemma":"אֲבִירָם","tr":"a·vi·ram","gloss":"Abiram","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":11},{"base":"H5327","lemma":"נָצָה","tr":"na·tsah","gloss":"to struggle","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":11},{"base":"H0446","lemma":"אֱלִיאָב","tr":"e·li·av","gloss":"Eliab","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":21},{"base":"H7205","lemma":"רְאוּבֵן","tr":"re·u·ven","gloss":"Reuben","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":72},{"base":"H2697","lemma":"חֶצְרוֹנִי","tr":"chets·ro·ni","gloss":"Hezronite","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":2}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"NUM","chapter":16,"verse":38,"verseEnd":38,"votes":8,"source":"both","text":"As for the censers of those who sinned at the cost of their own lives, hammer them into sheets to overlay the altar, for these were presented before the LORD, and so have become holy. They will serve as a sign to the Israelites.”","from":10},{"book":"NUM","chapter":1,"verse":16,"verseEnd":16,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"These men were appointed from the congregation; they were the leaders of the tribes of their fathers, the heads of the clans of Israel.","from":9},{"book":"GEN","chapter":29,"verse":32,"verseEnd":32,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"And Leah conceived and gave birth to a son, and she named him Reuben, for she said, “The Lordhas seen my affliction. Surely my husband will love me now.”","from":5},{"book":"GEN","chapter":46,"verse":8,"verseEnd":9,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Now these are the names of the sons of Israel (Jacob and his descendants) who went to Egypt: Reuben, Jacobʼs firstborn. The sons of Reuben: Hanoch, Pallu, Hezron, and Carmi.","from":5},{"book":"GEN","chapter":46,"verse":9,"verseEnd":9,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"The sons of Reuben: Hanoch, Pallu, Hezron, and Carmi.","from":7},{"book":"GEN","chapter":49,"verse":2,"verseEnd":3,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Come together and listen, O sons of Jacob; listen to your father Israel. Reuben, you are my firstborn, my might, and the beginning of my strength, excelling in honor, excelling in power.","from":5},{"book":"EXO","chapter":6,"verse":14,"verseEnd":14,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"These were the heads of their fathersʼ houses: The sons of Reuben, the firstborn of Israel, were Hanoch and Pallu, Hezron and Carmi. These were the clans of Reuben.","from":5},{"book":"EXO","chapter":6,"verse":24,"verseEnd":24,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"The sons of Korah were Assir, Elkanah, and Abiasaph. These were the clans of the Korahites.","from":11}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"exodus-family","title":"Moses and his circle","people":5},{"id":"patriarchs","title":"The patriarchal families","people":2}]},"12-22":{"people":[{"id":"simeon-h8095g","name":"Simeon","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":2,"firstVerse":12},{"id":"jachin-h3199g","name":"Jachin","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Simeon","count":1,"firstVerse":12},{"id":"jamin-h3226g","name":"Jamin","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Simeon","count":1,"firstVerse":12},{"id":"jemuel-h3223","name":"Jemuel","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Simeon","count":1,"firstVerse":12},{"id":"shaul-h7586h","name":"Shaul","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Simeon","count":1,"firstVerse":13},{"id":"zerah-h2226l","name":"Zerah","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Simeon","count":1,"firstVerse":13},{"id":"gad-h1410g","name":"Gad","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":2,"firstVerse":15},{"id":"haggi-h2291","name":"Haggi","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Gad","count":1,"firstVerse":15},{"id":"shuni-h7764","name":"Shuni","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Gad","count":1,"firstVerse":15},{"id":"ziphion-h6837","name":"Ziphion","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Gad","count":1,"firstVerse":15},{"id":"eri-h6179","name":"Eri","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Gad","count":1,"firstVerse":16},{"id":"ezbon-h0675g","name":"Ezbon","kind":"per