xt":"And that night God spoke to Israel in a vision: “Jacob, Jacob!” He said. “Here I am,” replied Jacob.","from":38},{"book":"GEN","chapter":46,"verse":17,"verseEnd":17,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"The children of Asher: Imnah, Ishvah, Ishvi, Beriah, and their sister Serah. The sons of Beriah: Heber and Malchiel.","from":44},{"book":"GEN","chapter":46,"verse":17,"verseEnd":17,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"The children of Asher: Imnah, Ishvah, Ishvi, Beriah, and their sister Serah. The sons of Beriah: Heber and Malchiel.","from":46},{"book":"GEN","chapter":46,"verse":21,"verseEnd":21,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"The sons of Benjamin: Bela, Becher, Ashbel, Gera, Naaman, Ehi, Rosh, Muppim, Huppim, and Ard.","from":39},{"book":"GEN","chapter":46,"verse":21,"verseEnd":21,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"The sons of Benjamin: Bela, Becher, Ashbel, Gera, Naaman, Ehi, Rosh, Muppim, Huppim, and Ard.","from":41}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"patriarchs","title":"The patriarchal families","people":4}]},"52-56":{"people":[{"id":"moses-h4872","name":"Moses","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Amram","count":1,"firstVerse":52}],"places":[],"words":[{"base":"H5159","lemma":"נַחֲלָה","tr":"na·cha·lah","gloss":"inheritance","lang":"h","inPassage":5,"uses":222},{"base":"H2505","lemma":"חָלַק","tr":"cha·laq","gloss":"to divide","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":65},{"base":"H1486","lemma":"גּוֹרָל","tr":"go·ral","gloss":"allotted","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":77},{"base":"H4592","lemma":"מְעַט","tr":"me·at","gloss":"little","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":101},{"base":"H7227","lemma":"רַב","tr":"rav","gloss":"many","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":454},{"base":"H6310","lemma":"פֶּה","tr":"peh","gloss":"lip","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":498},{"base":"H8034","lemma":"שֵׁם","tr":"shem","gloss":"name","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":864},{"base":"H4591","lemma":"מָעַט","tr":"ma·at","gloss":"to diminish","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":22},{"base":"H5157","lemma":"נָחַל","tr":"na·chal","gloss":"to inherit","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":59},{"base":"H4557","lemma":"מִסְפָּר","tr":"mis·par","gloss":"number","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":134}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"NUM","chapter":33,"verse":54,"verseEnd":54,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"And you are to divide the land by lot according to your clans. Give a larger inheritance to a larger clan and a smaller inheritance to a smaller one. Whatever falls to each one by lot will be his. You will receive an inheritance according to the tribes of your fathers.","from":54},{"book":"GEN","chapter":12,"verse":2,"verseEnd":2,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"I will make you into a great nation, and I will bless you; I will make your name great, so that you will be a blessing.","from":53},{"book":"GEN","chapter":12,"verse":7,"verseEnd":7,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Then the Lordappeared to Abram and said, “I will give this land to your offspring.” So Abram built an altar there to the Lord, who had appeared to him.","from":53},{"book":"NUM","chapter":32,"verse":3,"verseEnd":3,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"“Ataroth, Dibon, Jazer, Nimrah, Heshbon, Elealeh, Sebam, Nebo, and Beon,","from":54},{"book":"NUM","chapter":32,"verse":5,"verseEnd":5,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"“If we have found favor in your sight,” they said, “let this land be given to your servants as a possession. Do not make us cross the Jordan.”","from":54},{"book":"NUM","chapter":33,"verse":54,"verseEnd":54,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"And you are to divide the land by lot according to your clans. Give a larger inheritance to a larger clan and a smaller inheritance to a smaller one. Whatever falls to each one by lot will be his. You will receive an inheritance according to the tribes of your fathers.","from":55},{"book":"NUM","chapter":34,"verse":13,"verseEnd":13,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"So Moses commanded the Israelites, “Apportion this land by lot as an inheritance. The LORD has commanded that it be given to the nine and a half tribes.","from":55},{"book":"JOS","chapter":11,"verse":23,"verseEnd":23,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"So Joshua took the entire land, in keeping with all that the LORD had spoken to Moses. And Joshua gave it as an inheritance to Israel according to the allotments to their tribes. Then the land had rest from war.","from":53}],"notes":[],"groups":[]},"57-65":{"people":[{"id":"levi-h3878","name":"Levi","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":3,"firstVerse":57},{"id":"kohath-h6955","name":"Kohath","kind":"person","brief":"Levi's son","count":2,"firstVerse":57},{"id":"gershon-h1648","name":"Gershon","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Levi","count":1,"firstVerse":57},{"id":"merari-h4847","name":"Merari","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Levi","count":1,"firstVerse":57},{"id":"amram-h6019g","name":"Amram","kind":"person","brief":"Moses' father","count":2,"firstVerse":58},{"id":"hebron-h2275b","name":"Hebron","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Kohath","count":1,"firstVerse":58},{"id":"korah-h7141i","name":"Korah","kind":"person","brief":"Aaron's adversary","count":1,"firstVerse":58},{"id":"libni-h3845g","name":"Libni","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Gershon","count":1,"firstVerse":58},{"id":"mahli-h4249g","name":"Mahli","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Merari","count":1,"firstVerse":58},{"id":"mushi-h4187","name":"Mushi","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Merari","count":1,"firstVerse":58},{"id":"aaron-h0175","name":"Aaron","kind":"person","brief":"High Priest","count":3,"firstVerse":59},{"id":"moses-h4872","name":"Moses","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Amram","count":3,"firstVerse":59},{"id":"jochebed-h3115","name":"Jochebed","kind":"person","brief":"Sister of Gershon","count":1,"firstVerse":59},{"id":"miriam-h4813g","name":"Miriam","kind":"person","brief":"Moses' sister","count":1,"firstVerse":59},{"id":"abihu-h0030","name":"Abihu","kind":"person","brief":"A priest","count":2,"firstVerse":60},{"id":"eleazar-h0499g","name":"Eleazar","kind":"per